{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_17217090","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17217090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1721708001:":{"text":"君たちは少し下がっていてくれ。","source_cn":"其他人先行退下吧","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4EDF02F808163BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1721708002:":{"text":"ヘンドリック卿と話があるんだ。","source_cn":"我与亨德里克卿有事相谈","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F83B9033FF8F864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1721708003:":{"text":"はっ！","source_cn":"是！<key:dialog67>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7C3D2F2D0F425F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1721708005:":{"text":"はっ！","source_cn":"是！<key:dialog8>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB38242E392B111CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1721708004:":{"text":"はっ！","source_cn":"是！<key:dialog7>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA80ED37F21F2D72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1721708006:":{"text":"はっ！","source_cn":"是！<key:dialog15>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC3FA42F3F28093C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721709001:0":{"text":"突然のご訪問をお許しください、殿下。実は、どうしても直接お尋ねしたいことがありまして。","source_cn":"殿下，冒昧前来，是因为有些话，我必须当面问清楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x706ECEC5119FEA84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721709002:0":{"text":"古聖堂が消えたあの日……殿下はディアグレスと聖堂の中で、何をなさっていたのですか？","source_cn":"圣古堂失踪的那天……您和迪尔格雷首席，在里面做了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB99A02FD25C4A415","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721709003:0":{"text":"それはどういう意味かな、ヘンドリック卿。私たちは中で大帝に礼拝を捧げていただけだ。何か問題でも？","source_cn":"亨德里克卿，我不明白你的意思。那天我和首席只是祭拜了大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60F2A134A80B848B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721709004:0":{"text":"失礼ながら、殿下がお出になった直後、入れ替わるように姫様がお入りになり、すぐにあの騒ぎが起きました……ただの偶然とは思えません。","source_cn":"这就是最大的问题。您前脚刚离开，后脚佩吉殿下进去就出了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE26C21A4DF44F82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721709005:0":{"text":"……殿下。あなたが心優しいお方であることは、幼い頃から見守ってきた私がよく存じております。","source_cn":"……殿下，我看着您长大，我知道您本性纯良。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFFAC56087C499B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721709006:0":{"text":"ですがディアグレスが……あの古狸が、ヘイスティングズ家をはじめとする厄介な貴族たちと深く結びついていることは、宮廷では公然の秘密です。","source_cn":"但是迪尔格雷……那个老家伙跟黑斯廷斯家族，还有几个不安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3183BB942FECAA75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721709007:0":{"text":"もしや、奴らは殿下の信頼に付け込み、古聖堂に何か細工をしたうえで……殿下までその企みに巻き込んだのではありませんか？","source_cn":"不是他们利用您的信任，在圣古堂里动了什么手脚，甚至……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1984DEEF47B604D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721709008:0":{"text":"何を根拠にそんなことを……ずいぶん想像力がたくましいのだな、ヘンドリック卿。","source_cn":"亨德里克卿，你的想象力很丰富。竟然有这种无端的猜测……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA198BC46B905DFF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721709009:0":{"text":"守備軍の指揮官が、証拠もなしに首席宮廷魔術師やヘイスティングズ家を糾弾するのは、賢明とは言えないな。","source_cn":"作为守备军司令，在这没有证据的情况下指控宫廷首席魔法师...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B12E011F410EF56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721709010:0":{"text":"……殿下、すでに上層街のベルベット・トラップにも捜査の手が及んでいます。その経営者であるファティマという女性は――","source_cn":"……殿下，现有调查已经追溯到了上城区的丝绒陷阱。那个名...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFA4767D76AB0511","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721709011:0":{"text":"当時、<style=\"highlight\">ガード侯爵</style>――すなわちヘイスティングズ家の当主が、サバンナに招き入れたのです。","source_cn":"她是当初被<style=highlight>嘉德侯爵<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22779290FCB896AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1721709012:0":{"text":"ヘイスティングズ家、ファティマ、ディアグレス……事態はもう、あまりにも大きくなりすぎています。","source_cn":"黑斯廷斯家族、法蒂玛、迪尔格雷……这张网已经织得够大了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84987E8EB8B2F02D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1721709013:0":{"text":"殿下、あなたの目的が何であれ、誰に唆されたにせよ、今ならまだ間に合います！","source_cn":"殿下，不管您是为了什么目的，或者受了谁的蒙蔽，现在收手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCE7650396BACF72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1721709014:0":{"text":"このまま取り返しのつかない事態になれば、たとえこの私でも、妃殿下の御前で殿下を庇いきれるかどうか……","source_cn":"如果真的闹到不可收拾的地步，就算是我，也没法在陛下面前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC94AAFE0B33DE86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1721709015:0":{"text":"私を庇う？ヘンドリック卿、何か勘違いしているようだが、私はブライトの王太子、いずれ国王となる身だ。誰の庇い立ても必要ない。","source_cn":"保全我？亨德里克卿，您似乎搞错了一件事。我是耀光的王储...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA97AF264135E200","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1721709016:0":{"text":"どうやら、最近いろいろありすぎて、君も疲れているようだ。そのせいで、ありもしないことまで考えてしまったのだろう……","source_cn":"看来，最近这一连串的事情，确实让您太累了。累到让您开始...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69219C70FF92E2A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1721709017:0":{"text":"これでは守備軍の任務にも集中できないだろう。今日の狩猟には同行しなくていいぞ。","source_cn":"既然您的心思已经不在守备军的正事上，那么，今日的皇家行...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DDA1D02FCDD1AF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1721709018:0":{"text":"護衛は他の者を手配する。ヘンドリック卿、君は駐屯地でゆっくり体を休めるといい。","source_cn":"我会安排人手接手防务。亨德里克卿，您还是留在驻地，好好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B01D2D0204BAA0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1721709019:0":{"text":"殿下……","source_cn":"殿下……<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x452E33441BD7A9BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1721709020:0":{"text":"これは命令だ、ヘンドリック指揮官。もう下がっていいぞ。","source_cn":"这是命令，亨德里克司令。退下吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D578C9E60991EA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1721709021:0":{"text":"……承知いたしました。どうか……くれぐれもご自重ください。","source_cn":"……遵命。希望您……好自为之。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A3394CBFF03BE5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:26:17021714:0":{"text":"エイドリアンとヘンドリックは人払いをした。どうやら重要な話をするようだ。","source_cn":"奥利安与亨德里克屏退众人，似乎要商量什么要事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB34CBC9D455E2BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奥利安":{"text":"エイドリアン","source":"奥利安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:守备军1":{"text":"守备军1","source":"守备军1","status":"source"},"speaker:守备军3":{"text":"守备军3","source":"守备军3","status":"source"},"speaker:守备军2":{"text":"守备军2","source":"守备军2","status":"source"},"speaker:守备军4":{"text":"守备军4","source":"守备军4","status":"source"},"speaker:亨德里克":{"text":"ヘンドリック","source":"亨德里克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"黒画面字幕","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":33,"localized_text_count":28,"speaker_count":7}}